SUMMARY:SameBoy v1.0.4
DESCRIPTION:SameBoy 1.0.4 | sameboy_ios_v1.0.4\n\nThis version is backwards
  compatible with save states from SameBoy 0.14.3 and newer\, as well as sa
 ve states from any BESS compliant emulator\n\n## New/Improved Features\n* 
 The libretro core now supports API extensions to retrieve additional metad
 ata and create more portable battery save files\n* The iOS frontend has be
 en updated with improved iOS 27 support\n* iPhone Duo support was added to
  the iOS frontend\n* The CRT scaling filter has been updated with an impro
 ved look\n* A new Pixelated/Sharp Bilinear scaling filter\n    * This new 
 filter is now the default filter in the Cocoa and SDL frontends\n* VFS sup
 port was added to the libretro core\n* Logging support was added to the li
 bretro core\n* The libretro core will now render audio directly in the fro
 ntend's audio sample rate\, if supported\n* Recording audio to a VGM log f
 ile is now possible in the Cocoa and SDL frontends\n* Minor UI improvement
 s in the Cocoa frontend\n\n## Accuracy Improvements/Fixes\n* Workboy emula
 tion now correctly reports the current weekday\n* Fixed a bug that made ce
 rtain small ROM files be incorrectly detected as MMM01 cartridges\n* More 
 accurate emulation of SGB command processing\n\n## Bug Fixes\n* Fixed a bu
 g where periodic battery saves were performed from the wrong thread in the
  Cocoa frontend\, causing debug builds to crash\n* Fixed controller hotkey
 s not working on newer macOS versions in the Cocoa frontend\n* Fixed a bug
  that prevented mapping Load State commands to a controller hotkey in the 
 Cocoa frontend\n* The libretro core no longer reports an RTC memory region
  when emulating cartridges without an RTC\n* Fixed a bug that could trigge
 r memory corruptions on x86-64 platforms when loading malformed save state
 s\n* Improved sanitization of the Game Boy Printer save state data\n* Fixe
 d an incorrectly label “Rumble strength” label in the Cocoa frontend\n
 * File dialogs on Windows now switch Full Screen mode off before they appe
 ar\, working around bugs in Windows' windowing syst
URL:https://raynmahbub.github.io/OmniSource/feeds/sameboy.json
END:VEVENT
